                                                "sense_id": "9cf3844d-7af5-370e-93bf-7590b9bbabc5",
                                                "text": "\"You must not come to me,\" answered her listener, \"for a defence of society; I have long since loathed its bitterness as much as I despise its baseness. You cannot know the miserably mean motives that actuate the generality; but the trifles so sought give their own narrowness to the mind.\""
